            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[## Dictate Anywhere 2.12.21

- AssemblyAI prompt settings now match the selected output mode. Verbatim shows recognition context, and Polished also shows cleanup, destination, writing style, and field context.
- Parakeet skips an extra audio pass when none of your custom vocabulary terms can correct the transcript. Thanks to @achembarpu for the improvement.
]]></description>
